00:27:02.390 --> 00:27:03.972
We have a lot of
customers who are

00:27:03.972 --> 00:27:05.430
familiar with using
these products,

00:27:05.430 --> 00:27:08.510
and we to make sure they have
a great experience in GCP.

00:27:08.510 --> 00:27:10.640
And also these
partners have products

00:27:10.640 --> 00:27:12.835
